#: src/features/homepage/page.tsx
msgid "<0>Free forever and open source.</0><1/>No ads, paywalls, or tracking."
msgstr "<0>Abadiy bepul va ochiq manbali.</0><1/>Reklama, to‘lov devorlari va kuzatuv yo‘q."

#: src/routes/builder/$resumeId/-sidebar/right/sections/information.tsx
msgid "<0>Thank you for using Reactive Resume. I build this app mostly in my spare time, with help from open-source contributors around the world.</0><1>If it has been useful to you and you'd like to keep it free and open for everyone, please consider donating. Any amount helps.</1>"
msgstr "<0>Reactive Resume'dan foydalanganingiz uchun rahmat. Men bu ilovani asosan bo'sh vaqtimda, dunyo bo'ylab ochiq manba hamjamiyati ishtirokchilari yordamida ishlab chiqaman.</0><1>Agar u sizga foydali bo'lgan bo'lsa va uning hamma uchun bepul va ochiq qolishini istasangiz, xayriya qilishni o'ylab ko'ring. Har qanday miqdor yordam beradi.</1>"

#: src/features/homepage/export-playground.tsx
msgid "<p>I design software for teams, from early research to the details people use every day.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Men jamoalar uchun dasturiy ta’minotni loyihalashtiraman — dastlabki tadqiqotlardan tortib, odamlar har kuni ishlatadigan detallargacha.</p>"

#: src/features/homepage/export-playground.tsx
msgid "<ul><li>Designed responsive websites and mobile experiences for small businesses.</li><li>Worked with developers from first sketches through release.</li></ul>"
msgstr "<ul><li>Kichik bizneslar uchun responsiv veb-saytlar va mobil tajribalarni loyihalashtirdim.</li><li>Ishlab chiquvchilar bilan dastlabki eskizlardan to nashrgacha birga ishladim.</li></ul>"

#: src/features/homepage/export-playground.tsx
msgid "<ul><li>Led research and interface design for a collaborative planning tool.</li><li>Built a shared component library with engineers and documented accessibility patterns.</li><li>Tested prototypes with customers and used their feedback to simplify onboarding.</li></ul>"
msgstr "<ul><li>Birgalikda rejalashtirish vositasi uchun tadqiqot va interfeys dizaynini boshqardim.</li><li>Muhandislar bilan umumiy komponentlar kutubxonasini qurdim va mavjudlik naqshlarini hujjatlashtirdim.</li><li>Prototiplarni mijozlar bilan sinab ko‘rdim va ularning fikr-mulohazalaridan foydalanish jarayonini soddalashtirdim.</li></ul>"

